# Eval runs. eval/ IS tracked (a17-qrels.json, top8-baseline.txt live there), so these are ignored
# individually rather than by ignoring the directory:
#   runs/  — one JSONL + one report per run. 2,556 rows x 60 slugs is megabytes, diffed as text.
#   .eval-workspaces.json — local workspace ids from seed:eval; meaningless on another machine.
eval/runs/
eval/.eval-workspaces.json
